WEBVTT

00:01:26.646 --> 00:01:31.306
But it was then that I realized also
that we have a wall of anger,

00:01:31.306 --> 00:01:36.919
of hatred and of ignorance
that separates us.

00:01:36.919 --> 00:01:41.418
I decided that it doesn't matter
what happens to me.

00:01:41.418 --> 00:01:44.111
What really matters is how I deal with it.

00:01:44.111 --> 00:01:47.455
And therefore, I decided
to dedicate my life

00:01:47.455 --> 00:01:51.843
to bringing down the walls
that separate people.

00:01:51.843 --> 00:01:53.863
I do so through many ways.

00:01:53.863 --> 00:01:56.963
Tourism is one of them,
but also media and education,

00:01:56.963 --> 00:02:00.657
and you might be wondering,
really, can tourism change things?